round":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_jwVzkP"]},"accordion_row_9AdRF9":{"type":"_accordion-row","settings":{"heading":"¿Cuándo inicia el Black Week?","open_by_default":false,"icon":"none","width":20},"blocks":{"text_KfCQGh":{"type":"text","settings":{"text":"<p>El inicio de la semana de descuentos suele coincidir con los días previos al viernes negro, extendiéndose hasta incluir el Cyber Monday. En Mundo In publicamos fechas, condiciones y ofertas Black Week en nuestras plataformas desde septiembre para que no pierdas ninguna oportunidad.<\/p>","width":"100%","max_width":"none","alignment":"left","type_preset":"rte","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_KfCQGh"]},"accordion_row_EhhY9m":{"type":"_accordion-row","name":"t:names.accordion_dash_row","settings":{"heading":"¿Cuánto dura el Black Week?","open_by_default":false,"icon":"none","width":20},"blocks":{"text_LK7m3J":{"type":"text","name":"t:names.text","settings":{"text":"<p>Generalmente, abarca entre el 24 al 30 de noviembre. Las tiendas adaptan su estrategia según el comportamiento de las ventas y la respuesta de los consumidores. En Mundo In mantenemos una cadena de ofertas escalonadas para que encuentres lo mejor cada día sin prisas.<\/p>","width":"100%","max_width":"none","alignment":"left","type_preset":"rte","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_LK7m3J"]},"accordion_row_NYaLdw":{"type":"_accordion-row","name":"t:names.accordion_dash_row","settings":{"heading":"¿Qué puedo esperar de las ofertas Black Week en Mundo In?","open_by_default":false,"icon":"none","width":20},"blocks":{"text_HdgAep":{"type":"text","name":"t:names.text","settings":{"text":"<p>Descuentos reales en categorías clave: productos de almacenamiento, salas, escritorios, mesas y sillas de oficina; servicios adicionales como envío gratis y armado; y diferentes formas de compra. Todo respaldado por información clara y experiencia garantizada.<\/p>","width":"100%","max_width":"none","alignment":"left","type_preset":"rte","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_HdgAep"]},"accordion_row_jNpnNF":{"type":"_accordion-row","name":"t:names.accordion_dash_row","settings":{"heading":"¿Cuál es la diferencia entre Black Friday y Black Week?","open_by_default":false,"icon":"none","width":20},"blocks":{"text_Xpfpfp":{"type":"text","name":"t:names.text","settings":{"text":"<p>El Black Friday es solo un día de ofertas, mientras que la Black Week extiende ese periodo para dar espacio a comparaciones, mejores decisiones y campañas temáticas por categoría. Así, puedes planear tu compra sin presiones y con mejor acceso a las mejores ofertas.<\/p>","width":"100%","max_width":"none","alignment":"left","type_preset":"rte","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_Xpfpfp"]},"accordion_row_t877mk":{"type":"_accordion-row","name":"t:names.accordion_dash_row","settings":{"heading":"¿Cómo puedo comprar en línea durante Black Week?","open_by_default":false,"icon":"none","width":20},"blocks":{"text_bRjm8h":{"type":"text","name":"t:names.text","settings":{"text":"<p>Accede a nuestra tienda en línea, elige tu producto, verifica las condiciones, selecciona método de pago y confirma tu dirección. Si necesitas ayuda, nuestro equipo resolverá tus dudas en cuanto a medidas, materiales y entrega.<\/p>","width":"100%","max_width":"none","alignment":"left","type_preset":"rte","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padding-block-end":0,"padding-inline-start":0,"padding-inline-end":0},"blocks":{}}},"block_order":["text_bRjm8h"]},"accordion_row_JfaTCT":{"type":"_accordion-row","name":"t:names.accordion_dash_row","settings":{"heading":"¿Qué métodos de pago estarán disponibles durante el Black Week?","open_by_default":false,"icon":"none","width":20},"blocks":{"text_qjqK7j":{"type":"text","name":"t:names.text","settings":{"text":"<p>Tendrás acceso a PayPal, tarjetas bancarias, transferencia y pago contra entrega en zonas autorizadas. Para montos mayores, consulta la opción de meses sin intereses y promociones específicas con tu banco.<\/p>","width":"100%","max_width":"none","alignment":"left","type_preset":"rte","font":"var(--font-body--family)","font_size":"1rem","line_height":"normal","letter_spacing":"normal","case":"none","wrap":"pretty","color":"var(--color-foreground)","background":false,"background_color":"#00000026","corner_radius":0,"padding-block-start":0,"padd